197802198, "y1": 0.5656565656565656}, {"text": "Question 1 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5897435897435898, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.6021756021756022}, {"text": "How does Yatu Widders-Hunt describe herself to the audience?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6216006216006216, "x1": 0.6362637362637362, "y1": 0.6317016317016317}, {"text": "CANDIDATE'S NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.6043956043956044, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "9287310054 |", "x0": 0.7769230769230769, "y0": 0.037296037296037296, "x1": 0.9307692307692308, "y1": 0.059052059052059055}, {"text": "Question 2 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "Describe how Indigenous designers work in \u2018a really different way\u2019.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.6725274725274726, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "Question 3 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.33022533022533024, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.34265734265734266}, {"text": "According to Yatu Widders-Hunt, what is the connection between storytelling and fashion?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.36363636363636365, "x1": 0.8615384615384616, "y1": 0.37684537684537683}, {"text": "Please turn over", "x0": 0.42967032967032964, "y0": 0.6487956487956488, "x1": 0.5692307692307692, "y1": 0.6588966588966589}, {"text": "CANDIDATE'S NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.6043956043956044, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "Question 4 (4 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "Explain why Yatu Widders-Hunt believes social media has supported the Indigenous fashion", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}